<title>USA: Novametrix says FDA approves VentCheck.</title>
<headline>Novametrix says FDA approves VentCheck.</headline>
<dateline>WALLINGFORD, Conn. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novametrix Medical Systems Inc said Wednesday it has received U.S. Food and Drug Administration clearance to market its new VentCheck hand-held respiratory mechanics monitor.</p>
<p>A spokesman said VentCheck would be used by doctors and clinicians on people needing assistance breathing. The device measures how well the patient is being ventilated.</p>
